# Local development tests. Kept locally for running pytest and the
# doctest/coverage checks described in the README, but not part of
# what gets submitted to Gradescope -- the verified full-mark
# reference submission for this assignment has no tests/ directory,
# and this project's Gradescope docstring/doctest/tool-layout grading
# appears to scan every .py file in the submitted repo, including
# these. Excluding tests/ from the submitted repo keeps that grading
# scoped to chat.py and tools/, matching the reference.
tests/
